  "bodyHash": "694ad05081a89aae",
  "content": "\n\n<h2>人类村民</h2>\n<h4><strong>需要模组 [EMF] &amp; [ETF]：</strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[EMF] Entity Model Features [Forge, Fabric &amp; NeoForge]</a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[ETF] Entity Texture Features - [Forge, Fabric &amp; NeoForge]</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>改变了村民的外观，为所有生物群落和所有职业提供了全新的独特造型，同时力求保持原版风格。</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">关键特性：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>全新外观：</strong>村民现在拥有与玩家相同大小的头部，增加了耳朵、随机生成的皮肤、风格化的发型和眼睛颜色，双手自由且手臂摆动与移动速度同步。</li>\n<li><strong>皮肤重设计：</strong>每个生物群落和职业都拥有独特且重新设计的造型，多种变体确保了与游戏世界观一致的视觉多样性。</li>\n<li><strong>按生物群落变化的村民：</strong>添加了随生物群落变化的新村民，例如樱花林地村民、下陷地村民、灵魂沙砾村民等……\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>新的沙漠和下陷地村民</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>下陷地村民</li>\n<li>红岩村民</li>\n<li>干旱地村民</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>新的平原村民</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>蘑菇村民</li>\n<li>樱花林地村民</li>\n<li>繁茂洞穴村民</li>\n<li>发光蘑菇村民</li>\n<li>古木村民</li>\n<li>哭泣女巫森林村民</li>\n<li>天空谷村民</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>新的下界村民</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>绯红森林村民</li>\n<li>诡异森林村民</li>\n<li>灵魂沙砾村民</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>新的沼泽村民</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>红树林村民</li>\n<li>湾地村民</li>\n<li>沼泽村民</li>\n<li>泥炭地村民</li>\n<li>不祥村民</li>\n<li>湿地村民</li>\n<li>苍绿花园村民</li>\n</ul>\n<p>新的末地村民</p>\n<ul>\n<li>末影村民（需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender Villages</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>广泛的兼容性：</strong>包含来自多个模组的众多自定义村民，确保无缝集成。\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bakery-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bakery Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountiful-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bountiful Villager</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cherry-samurai-temple\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cherry Samurai Temple</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/daiku-worker-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Daiku: Worker Villagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/data-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Data Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-dark-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep Dark Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/desert-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Desert Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diamond-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Diamond Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy villagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/garbage-collector-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Garbage Collector Villager</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guard Villagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Guard Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvester-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Harvester trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/homesteads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Homesteads</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hunter-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hunter Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Illager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-chef-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Illager Chef</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jungle-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jungle Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/leaf-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Leaf Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deep-dark-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L's Deep Dark Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lush-cave-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lush Cave Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/millager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Millager (Village Defenders)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monster-hunter-villager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Monster Hunter Villager</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-traders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Traders</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Villagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mushroom-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mushroom Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nebulus-trader-for-the-desert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nebulus desert trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nebulus-juice-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nebulus juice trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-villager-merchant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Merchant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ocean-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ocean Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-ore-traders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ore traders</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pale-garden-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pale garden trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plains-villager-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Plains Villager Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/railcraft-reborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Railcraft Reborn</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Recruits</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sawmill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sawmill</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/taxbiometrader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">T&amp;L's Biome Trader</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trial-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trial Villagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-enchanter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Enchanter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villagersplus-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Plus</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-retaliation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Villager Retaliation!</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visiting-villagers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visiting Villagers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/workers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Workers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-trader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">XP Trader</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li><strong>支持模组生物群落和村庄：</strong>将其他模组的修改版生物群落与新服装变体进行整合。\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/badland-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Badland Villages</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cherry-grove-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cherry Grove Villages</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ender Villages</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/incendium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Incendium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmv-moogs-missing-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog's Missing Villages</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions unexplored</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a> (苍绿花园)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1544973/description_ac18ba24-1352-413d-8c05-cc322d63cad5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong></p>\n<p>为村民守卫、新兵和工人分配人类尺寸的头部：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>你需要在 .minecraft/config/ 文件夹中的配置文件中修改以下值：</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">对于守卫村民：</span>在文件 <strong>guardvillagers-client.toml</strong> 中，将以下值更改为 true</p>\n<p><code>&ldquo;Have guards use the Steve model?&rdquo; = true</code></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">对于新兵和工人村民：</span>在文件 <strong>recruit-client.toml</strong> 中，将以下值更改为 false</p>\n<p><code>RecruitsLookLikeVillagers = false</code></p>\n</div>",
